# The one-way finale. Every arrow the player has turned so far pointed east or
# west; this one has to point DOWN. The locked tee at r2c1 offers its east mouth
# to o3 one last time and is refused, so the route is north, along the top, and
# then through an arrow the player must aim south to drop into the pools below.
